  "_doc": "Defiant tag registry — PROPOSAL, not yet wired into build.py. A curated controlled vocabulary, not a folksonomy. Every tag used in a note's frontmatter must resolve to a term here or QA fails; that gate is what keeps this an ontology instead of a tag cloud. Facets are orthogonal: a note carries at most one term per facet except condition/ and place/, which are multi-valued. Counts are always derived at build time, never stored. Aliases are the folksonomy intake ramp — misspellings and search-phrasing map inward to canonical terms without polluting the vocabulary.",
